      "writtenOn": "2026-03-16T14:34:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am surprised that it lets you compile this, since most other argument lists require items after something with a default value to also have a default value.\n\n`kIsDepthOnly` is doing very little in this function, so maybe we get rid of it?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 127,
